@startuml
title CON-SD-D11 Vendor Acknowledgment Failure and Reconciliation Flow
skinparam shadowing false

participant "Central PMS" as Central
participant "Site POS Server" as POS
participant "Vendor PMS Connector" as Connector
participant "Vendor PMS / HCP" as Vendor
participant "Reconciliation" as Recon
participant "Audit / Event" as Audit

Central -> Central : payment finality recorded
Central -> POS : fiscal issuance where required
POS --> Central : fiscal status
Central -> Connector : vendor acknowledgment if approved
Connector -> Vendor : acknowledgment attempt
alt acknowledged
  Vendor --> Connector : accepted / already paid
  Connector --> Central : normalized outcome
else failed / timeout / unavailable / unknown / conflict
  Vendor --> Connector : unsafe or failed outcome
  Connector --> Central : normalized failure context
  Central -> Recon : backlog / escalation / review
end
Connector -> Audit : acknowledgment context

note bottom
Vendor acknowledgment is not ExitPass payment finality.
Unknown outcome requires later-approved safe confirmation.
end note
@enduml
